WEBVTT

01:30.289 --> 01:34.950
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.280 --> 01:37.710
[Episode 8]

01:41.920 --> 01:43.130
Don't move.

01:59.960 --> 02:01.560
Can I move now?

03:19.630 --> 03:23.150
How much money would it take

03:24.340 --> 03:26.600
to buy your smile?

03:29.460 --> 03:31.800
To smile only for me?

04:03.690 --> 04:04.530
I got it.

04:17.529 --> 04:19.060
What filth is this?

04:20.990 --> 04:22.640
What filthy thing is this?

04:23.190 --> 04:24.010
What I need is

04:24.740 --> 04:25.660
human blood.

04:26.670 --> 04:29.150
I need virgin blood.

04:30.440 --> 04:32.290
Go find it for me!

04:32.680 --> 04:33.240
You!

04:33.530 --> 04:35.580
Did you hear me?

04:35.810 --> 04:37.980
The city gates are sealed now.

04:38.150 --> 04:40.880
The Feiyu Guard
is keeping watch there every day.

04:41.750 --> 04:42.870
Let me tell you.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.990
If I weren't waiting for Yunyi to return,

04:44.990 --> 04:47.140
I couldn't hold on anymore, you know?

04:47.880 --> 04:49.760
Do you hear me?

04:53.430 --> 04:54.190
Honey.

04:56.390 --> 04:59.490
Our Qionghua Sect still needs me now.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.430
We must eliminate evil spirits

05:02.430 --> 05:03.680
and uphold justice,

05:03.680 --> 05:05.280
have you forgotten all that?

05:07.750 --> 05:09.160
Eliminate evil spirits...

05:09.160 --> 05:09.630
Yeah.

05:11.950 --> 05:13.860
Then what do I see before me?

05:52.140 --> 05:53.659
[Yunlai Inn]

06:32.080 --> 06:33.680
What are you thinking about?

06:41.190 --> 06:41.870
Madam Jin?

06:42.750 --> 06:45.190
Miss Xiao Yao,
I know I'm being presumptuous,

06:45.190 --> 06:46.240
but I'm desperate about my daughter,

06:46.240 --> 06:47.900
and I hope you can understand.

06:48.230 --> 06:50.640
Could I ask you to guide me?

06:51.159 --> 06:53.290
I want to find Yunyi and bring her back.

06:54.390 --> 06:55.310
Please come in.

06:55.800 --> 06:56.240
Sit.

06:56.240 --> 06:56.840
All right.

06:58.950 --> 06:59.600
Thank you.

07:02.710 --> 07:04.840
Madam, you must still not trust me yet.

07:06.240 --> 07:07.680
Please don't misunderstand, miss.

07:07.680 --> 07:09.160
I've always trusted you.

07:10.270 --> 07:11.070
It's just that

07:11.310 --> 07:12.310
our Qionghua Sect

07:12.590 --> 07:14.720
has many matters to attend to,

07:14.960 --> 07:17.480
and we plan to leave Pingjiang soon.

07:19.950 --> 07:22.410
Even though
Yunyi's eyes are being treated,

07:22.630 --> 07:24.090
you can't wait any longer?

07:27.990 --> 07:30.120
Yunyi has been blind since childhood.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.000
Her father and I

07:31.000 --> 07:32.950
sought famous doctors everywhere
to treat her,

07:32.950 --> 07:34.280
but saw no improvement.

07:35.390 --> 07:36.990
Perhaps it's not an illness,

07:37.630 --> 07:38.680
but fate.

07:53.650 --> 07:55.180
Madam, what happened here?

08:01.180 --> 08:02.440
Perhaps it was the cat.

08:03.250 --> 08:05.020
Yes, it was the cat.

08:16.860 --> 08:18.670
You look haggard today.

08:18.980 --> 08:20.780
Did you not rest well last night?

08:21.870 --> 08:23.190
I heard that Qionghua Sect disciples

08:23.190 --> 08:25.320
were patrolling with the Feiyu Guard,

08:25.390 --> 08:27.190
and encountered a great demon last night,

08:27.190 --> 08:28.120
disturbing you.

08:30.240 --> 08:30.920
Last night,

08:31.080 --> 08:32.610
there was nothing unusual.

08:32.909 --> 08:33.750
Perhaps

08:33.960 --> 08:37.159
I was too worried about my daughter
and didn't sleep well.

08:39.909 --> 08:40.669
Indeed.

08:41.909 --> 08:43.600
Without seeing Yunyi with your own eyes,

08:43.600 --> 08:46.400
as her mother,
naturally you can't sleep soundly.

08:46.870 --> 08:47.730
I might as well—

08:47.870 --> 08:50.330
so I won't be accused
of being an accomplice.

08:51.450 --> 08:52.910
I'll take you to see her later.

08:52.910 --> 08:54.100
-Okay.
-But Madam,

08:54.320 --> 08:55.550
I drank too much last night.

08:55.550 --> 08:57.080
I need some time to prepare.

08:57.120 --> 08:58.510
Why don't you go back and rest first?

08:58.510 --> 08:59.630
In an hour,

08:59.840 --> 09:01.720
let's meet at the entrance of the inn.

09:01.720 --> 09:02.380
No problem.

09:03.730 --> 09:06.150
It seems Flower Lady misses Yunyi too.

09:06.170 --> 09:08.500
Look, she's so anxious she's scratching.

09:09.660 --> 09:11.320
Stay here, miss. See you later.

09:11.320 --> 09:11.920
All right.

09:22.910 --> 09:23.710
Good morning.

09:23.960 --> 09:25.690
I was just about to look for you.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.220
What's wrong with you?

09:29.920 --> 09:30.650
I'm smiling.

09:33.790 --> 09:34.920
Why are you smiling?

09:37.060 --> 09:40.230
How much money would it take

09:41.960 --> 09:43.870
to buy your smile?

09:44.440 --> 09:46.870
To smile only for me?

09:48.550 --> 09:49.350
It's nothing.

09:49.480 --> 09:51.280
What did you want to see me about?

09:53.080 --> 09:55.410
The real culprit is likely to appear soon.

10:05.070 --> 10:05.750
Li.

10:10.030 --> 10:10.670
Li.

10:11.630 --> 10:13.550
I think I can see you now,

10:15.640 --> 10:18.320
but I still can't see you clearly.

10:18.750 --> 10:19.610
With more time,

10:20.030 --> 10:21.160
you'll see clearly.

10:21.670 --> 10:22.130
Mm-hmm.

10:23.510 --> 10:24.510
I'm not in a hurry.

10:24.650 --> 10:26.580
I've waited so many years already.

10:28.840 --> 10:29.510
Li,

10:29.960 --> 10:30.870
when I can

10:31.080 --> 10:33.120
finally see clearly,

10:33.340 --> 10:34.680
will I be shocked?

10:35.390 --> 10:37.350
Will Dad and Mom

10:37.440 --> 10:39.370
be different from what I imagined?

10:40.320 --> 10:40.970
But

10:41.240 --> 10:43.800
you must be exactly

10:43.840 --> 10:45.070
like what I've imagined—

10:45.070 --> 10:46.330
incredibly handsome.

10:47.630 --> 10:48.430
I'm very ugly.

10:49.790 --> 10:51.240
You're so good to me.

10:51.460 --> 10:53.990
Even if you're truly ugly,
it doesn't matter.

10:59.960 --> 11:00.910
My disciples.

11:01.080 --> 11:01.740
-Yes!
-Yes!

11:02.080 --> 11:04.510
It's time again for us disciples
of Qionghua Sect

11:04.510 --> 11:06.710
to eliminate evil for the people.

11:07.270 --> 11:08.110
Miss Xiao Yao.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.140
I'm sorry.

11:09.720 --> 11:10.480
I originally thought

11:10.480 --> 11:11.510
just the two of us

11:11.510 --> 11:13.360
could quietly bring Yunyi back.

11:13.710 --> 11:15.160
But unexpectedly,

11:15.440 --> 11:17.040
my husband found out about it

11:17.150 --> 11:19.180
and now it has become

11:19.230 --> 11:21.120
this grand spectacle.

11:22.030 --> 11:22.670
It's all right.

11:22.670 --> 11:24.790
If Yunyi knew so many people
were going to get her,

11:24.790 --> 11:26.120
she would be very happy.

11:26.750 --> 11:30.020
We must eliminate all demons!

11:30.550 --> 11:31.150
We are

11:31.720 --> 11:33.050
duty-bound to do so!

11:33.200 --> 11:33.870
-Yes!
-Yes!

11:49.200 --> 11:49.910
Yunyi,

11:50.870 --> 11:52.670
your parents are here to see you.

11:53.960 --> 11:56.310
Yunyi, it's Mother!

11:56.600 --> 11:58.660
If you hear my voice, please come out.

12:06.600 --> 12:07.330
Lead the way.

12:08.790 --> 12:10.410
I would like to kindly remind you

12:10.410 --> 12:12.070
this fog can affect your mind.

12:12.150 --> 12:13.610
If your willpower is weak,

12:13.890 --> 12:16.140
you might even take your own life.

12:21.630 --> 12:23.120
Sect Leader and I will go in first.

12:23.120 --> 12:24.290
The rest of you wait here.

12:24.290 --> 12:25.690
We'll call if we need you.

12:28.060 --> 12:29.390
Master, Mistress, be careful!

12:29.390 --> 12:30.850
Please lead the way, miss.

12:55.720 --> 12:56.520
Miss Xiao Yao.

12:58.390 --> 12:59.270
Miss Xiao Yao.

13:03.130 --> 13:03.720
Muqing!

13:19.130 --> 13:20.950
Why have you trapped my soul?

13:21.440 --> 13:22.560
You demon...

13:23.000 --> 13:24.240
You hypocritical murderer.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.370
Give me back my life!

13:26.000 --> 13:27.600
Why have you trapped my soul?

13:28.080 --> 13:29.370
You demon.

13:29.400 --> 13:31.000
You hypocritical murderer!

13:31.040 --> 13:32.200
Give me back my life!

13:32.240 --> 13:34.020
Why have you trapped my soul?

13:34.360 --> 13:35.740
You demon!

13:35.870 --> 13:37.690
You hypocritical murderer!

13:37.720 --> 13:39.090
Give me back my life!

13:39.150 --> 13:40.080
Give me back my life!

13:40.080 --> 13:40.820
Murderer!

13:41.250 --> 13:42.730
Give me back my life!

13:43.320 --> 13:45.600
You hypocritical murderer!

13:46.450 --> 13:47.760
Give me back my life!

13:47.780 --> 13:49.030
Give me back my life!

13:49.080 --> 13:50.080
Give me back my life!

13:50.080 --> 13:51.290
Give me back my life!

13:51.340 --> 13:52.480
Give me back my life!

13:52.510 --> 13:53.240
Give me back my life!

13:53.240 --> 13:54.760
Murderer!

13:54.960 --> 13:56.120
Give me back my life!

13:56.120 --> 13:57.270
Give me back my life!

13:57.480 --> 13:58.210
Impossible!

13:58.790 --> 13:59.650
Impossible...

14:00.270 --> 14:01.170
Impossible!

14:01.620 --> 14:03.300
You're all already dead.

14:03.490 --> 14:06.160
These are just my illusions!

14:07.150 --> 14:09.000
Impossible!

14:09.020 --> 14:12.190
Give me back my life!
Give me back my life!

14:12.210 --> 14:14.360
Give my life back!

14:14.390 --> 14:15.750
Return my life now!

14:18.680 --> 14:20.050
Demon!

14:25.550 --> 14:27.280
Your true colors are revealed.

14:29.080 --> 14:30.960
You pose as a celestial cultivator,

14:30.960 --> 14:32.590
yet blame all your evil deeds

14:33.110 --> 14:34.870
on demons.

14:35.870 --> 14:36.920
Today, I, a demon,

14:37.670 --> 14:39.710
am ridding humans of a menace.

14:39.740 --> 14:40.460
Wait!

14:41.150 --> 14:43.810
Let's tie him up
and hand him over to the Feiyu Guard.

14:43.810 --> 14:45.210
Must I follow human rules

14:45.360 --> 14:46.830
when upholding justice?

14:49.950 --> 14:51.310
Please show mercy!

14:52.310 --> 14:53.240
Madam Jin?

14:53.550 --> 14:54.910
He acts righteous by day,

14:54.910 --> 14:56.320
but kills and drinks blood by night.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.150
With such evil deeds,

14:57.150 --> 14:58.410
you still protect him?

14:59.910 --> 15:01.600
Muqing became like this

15:04.670 --> 15:05.750
because of me.

15:08.110 --> 15:10.360
When Muqing first joined Qionghua Sect,

15:10.360 --> 15:12.090
his talent wasn't remarkable.

15:12.270 --> 15:13.200
His cultivation

15:13.790 --> 15:14.920
was rather slow too.

15:15.700 --> 15:17.180
But among all disciples,

15:17.240 --> 15:18.510
he was the most diligent

15:18.510 --> 15:19.550
and kindest to me.

15:21.250 --> 15:23.440
I had a heart condition since childhood.

15:23.440 --> 15:24.970
He often practiced with me,

15:25.360 --> 15:26.510
helped ease my pain,

15:27.270 --> 15:29.400
and even transferred his energy to me.

15:30.230 --> 15:31.850
Under his attentive care,

15:32.440 --> 15:34.170
my health gradually improved.

15:36.440 --> 15:38.500
My father saw his sincerity toward me

15:38.710 --> 15:40.370
and gave me to him in marriage.

15:41.270 --> 15:42.470
On our wedding night,

15:43.270 --> 15:44.960
I finally learned the truth.

15:45.030 --> 15:45.790
Hubby?

16:00.080 --> 16:00.740
Hubby?

16:10.170 --> 16:11.560
Honey, be quiet.

16:11.630 --> 16:13.620
Don't be afraid. It's me.

16:14.750 --> 16:15.680
Don't be scared!

16:15.780 --> 16:16.150
Honey.

16:16.150 --> 16:16.600
Don't come any closer!

16:16.600 --> 16:17.120
Honey.

16:17.200 --> 16:17.860
Stay back!

16:17.930 --> 16:18.860
Don't be afraid.

16:19.270 --> 16:20.910
Honey, don't scream.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.420
Listen to me.

16:22.630 --> 16:23.390
It's me.

16:24.630 --> 16:25.670
Don't be afraid.

16:26.480 --> 16:27.410
Don't be afraid.

16:28.840 --> 16:31.080
I lost control of my cultivation

16:31.720 --> 16:32.520
and my mind...

16:32.800 --> 16:34.390
my mind went astray

16:34.390 --> 16:35.910
to find a cure for you.

16:36.480 --> 16:37.320
Believe me.

16:37.840 --> 16:40.370
I never wanted to kill people
and drink blood.

16:40.980 --> 16:42.980
Honey, I have a Soul-binding Spell.

16:42.990 --> 16:44.590
I have a Soul-binding Spell!

16:45.200 --> 16:45.750
You...

16:45.800 --> 16:47.200
just stay there and talk.

16:47.360 --> 16:48.360
All right.

16:48.380 --> 16:50.140
Lower your voice.

16:50.510 --> 16:50.960
Honey.

16:52.910 --> 16:55.320
Once I use the Soul-binding Spell,

16:55.360 --> 16:57.710
they won't find the bodies, Honey.

16:58.270 --> 16:59.480
Trust me.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.000
Qionghua Sect

17:05.750 --> 17:07.349
is an orthodox immortal sect

17:07.880 --> 17:09.680
meant to eliminate evil spirits

17:09.930 --> 17:11.260
and protect the people.

17:15.510 --> 17:16.790
Look at what you've become.

17:16.790 --> 17:17.550
How will you

17:18.680 --> 17:20.480
reconcile with yourself in the future?

17:20.480 --> 17:22.000
Are you suggesting

17:24.160 --> 17:26.660
I should turn myself in to the authorities

17:26.720 --> 17:29.160
or lose all my powers

17:29.400 --> 17:31.030
and die in agony?

17:36.110 --> 17:36.750
Honey.

17:37.470 --> 17:39.360
I truly don't want to kill anyone.

17:40.940 --> 17:41.900
I promise you,

17:42.400 --> 17:44.030
unless absolutely necessary,

17:44.030 --> 17:45.400
I won't kill

17:45.400 --> 17:47.020
or drink blood!

17:47.510 --> 17:48.070
Honey.

17:49.240 --> 17:52.700
I truly wanted to save your life.

17:53.070 --> 17:54.440
Rest assured,

17:54.830 --> 17:57.590
I will help these souls find peace

17:57.590 --> 17:59.850
and reenter the cycle of reincarnation.

18:00.160 --> 18:01.590
Believe me.

18:03.750 --> 18:05.330
I didn't mean to do it.

18:05.510 --> 18:07.020
I didn't mean to do it.

18:07.240 --> 18:09.040
I never meant for this to happen.

18:10.550 --> 18:11.490
After that,

18:11.640 --> 18:15.000
we traveled everywhere with our disciples.

18:16.050 --> 18:17.640
We claimed to be hunting demons,

18:17.640 --> 18:18.370
but in truth,

18:19.620 --> 18:21.750
we were searching for the Yuli Spring.

18:21.920 --> 18:23.510
I know my sins are grave.

18:23.680 --> 18:26.080
I've thought
about ending my life with him.

18:26.270 --> 18:26.880
But then

18:27.320 --> 18:28.780
Yunyi came into our lives,

18:31.200 --> 18:32.860
and I couldn't let go anymore.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.510
Yunyi was born blind.

18:36.590 --> 18:38.450
Isn't that a form of retribution?

18:41.790 --> 18:43.750
But what fault is it of Yunyi's?

18:45.000 --> 18:46.160
So all these years,

18:46.510 --> 18:47.660
wherever we went,

18:47.720 --> 18:48.720
I prayed at every temple.

18:48.720 --> 18:50.050
I just wanted to pray...

18:52.610 --> 18:53.490
pray...

18:54.200 --> 18:55.730
for my sins to be lightened.

18:56.520 --> 18:58.790
[Temple of Eternal Life]

18:57.350 --> 18:58.720
I am burdened with sin.

18:59.030 --> 19:00.830
I beg the Bodhisattva for forgiveness.

19:00.830 --> 19:02.640
I vow to be vegetarian for life,

19:02.880 --> 19:04.510
to guide and save others,

19:04.880 --> 19:06.980
only asking to help the deceased
find peace

19:06.980 --> 19:08.780
and receive their forgiveness.

19:09.930 --> 19:11.870
May my daughter grow up safely

19:12.750 --> 19:15.210
and not bear the burden
of her parents' sins.

19:25.950 --> 19:28.310
Have you ever saved a man with a scar

19:28.940 --> 19:31.540
in a Bodhisattva Temple
on Qingyuan Mountain?

19:36.830 --> 19:38.040
I didn't save him.

19:42.070 --> 19:44.920
He ate the offerings

19:46.450 --> 19:48.050
and thus planted good karma.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.920
A mountain elf that is
neither human nor demon

19:54.920 --> 19:56.790
practices medicine to help others,

19:56.790 --> 19:58.250
yet is despised by people.

19:59.360 --> 20:01.120
The Sect Leader of Qionghua Sect

20:01.120 --> 20:02.650
has gone astray in cultivation,

20:02.650 --> 20:04.250
yet is revered by all.

20:07.210 --> 20:09.210
That's what the human realm is like.

20:10.350 --> 20:11.070
Go to sleep.

20:11.550 --> 20:12.590
When you wake up,

20:12.830 --> 20:14.430
your eyes will be able to see.

20:15.010 --> 20:16.590
I can't fall asleep.

20:16.860 --> 20:19.540
Why don't you tell me another story?

20:19.920 --> 20:21.480
I only have a few stories

20:21.810 --> 20:23.070
and I've told them all already.

20:23.070 --> 20:24.040
I don't care.

20:24.470 --> 20:25.620
Tell me another one.

20:25.740 --> 20:27.410
You can make up a new one.

20:31.920 --> 20:32.850
Once upon a time,

20:33.590 --> 20:34.920
there was a butcher and a monk

20:34.920 --> 20:36.200
who were good friends.

20:37.320 --> 20:39.450
They woke each other up every morning.

20:40.470 --> 20:41.900
But after they died,

20:42.740 --> 20:44.200
the butcher went to heaven

20:44.830 --> 20:46.360
while the monk went to hell.

20:47.200 --> 20:49.380
Because the butcher
did good deeds every day

20:49.380 --> 20:51.310
by waking the monk to chant sutras.

20:52.250 --> 20:54.510
While the monk woke the butcher every day

20:54.980 --> 20:56.440
only for him to take lives.

20:58.680 --> 20:59.240
Master.

20:59.640 --> 21:00.310
Master.

21:01.580 --> 21:02.910
Have you found Junior?

21:06.830 --> 21:07.510
Master.

21:08.790 --> 21:09.510
Master!

21:10.400 --> 21:10.960
Master!

21:11.550 --> 21:12.100
Master!

21:21.350 --> 21:22.200
It's over.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.570
It has finally come.

21:32.310 --> 21:34.370
I beg the Demon King not to interfere.

21:34.750 --> 21:36.010
I will end this myself.

21:37.440 --> 21:38.700
Leave my Qionghua Sect

21:39.350 --> 21:40.950
with its last bit of dignity.

21:45.920 --> 21:46.920
Miss Xiao Yao.

21:47.830 --> 21:48.630
In the future,

21:49.200 --> 21:50.000
if you...

21:50.960 --> 21:52.350
ever see Yunyi again,

21:53.310 --> 21:54.350
please tell her

21:55.070 --> 21:56.030
that her parents

21:59.310 --> 22:00.720
died hunting demons.

22:06.880 --> 22:07.550
I'm sorry

22:08.400 --> 22:09.110
you were

22:10.750 --> 22:12.440
wrongfully accused.

22:16.200 --> 22:16.880
Please.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.610
Don't worry, Madam.

22:55.560 --> 22:56.760
Keep your voice down.

22:57.000 --> 22:57.930
Yunyi is asleep.

22:59.790 --> 23:00.920
We found the killer.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.260
It was Yunyi's father,

23:03.440 --> 23:04.310
Jin Muqing.

23:09.110 --> 23:10.160
Yunyi's mother

23:12.110 --> 23:13.310
once at

23:14.160 --> 23:16.550
the Bodhisattva Temple
on Qingyuan Mountain

23:16.550 --> 23:18.150
helped guide a fated person.

23:19.440 --> 23:20.970
She guided many others too.

23:23.160 --> 23:25.760
But she could never redeem
her husband's sins.

23:27.510 --> 23:29.170
Your sins have been redeemed.

23:30.000 --> 23:31.200
That was their own karma—

23:31.200 --> 23:32.930
It was Jin Muqing's evil deeds.

23:34.790 --> 23:37.190
Madam should never have had
to pay for them.

23:42.200 --> 23:43.860
When Yunyi's eyes open again,

23:46.020 --> 23:47.510
please give her

23:48.830 --> 23:49.980
a clear world.

23:52.640 --> 23:54.070
Don't let her see

23:56.890 --> 23:59.090
the suffering of the human realm again.

24:11.560 --> 24:12.470
Let him go.

24:14.100 --> 24:16.900
He wants to protect the person
he cares about most.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.680
Qionghua Sect
has betrayed its own principles

24:38.680 --> 24:39.720
and harmed innocent people.

24:39.720 --> 24:41.450
The truth has now come to light.

24:41.550 --> 24:42.910
Surrender now!

24:59.960 --> 25:00.620
Senior.

25:06.480 --> 25:07.070
Senior.

25:21.680 --> 25:22.270
Honey.

25:23.030 --> 25:24.000
Tell them

25:24.720 --> 25:25.920
I didn't kill anyone.

25:26.750 --> 25:27.860
I'm innocent.

25:28.160 --> 25:29.890
I didn't commit those murders.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.720
I didn't kill anyone!

25:33.830 --> 25:35.070
You didn't kill them.

25:36.160 --> 25:37.220
Tell them quickly.

25:37.950 --> 25:39.680
Quick...

26:08.680 --> 26:09.680
I'm sorry.

26:11.160 --> 26:11.750
I

26:12.870 --> 26:14.500
am truly exhausted.

26:18.170 --> 26:19.820
Senior, do you remember

26:20.550 --> 26:22.580
when we got married,

26:23.350 --> 26:25.390
we promised Father

26:26.550 --> 26:28.730
to uphold justice for life

26:28.760 --> 26:30.420
and restore our sect's glory?

26:34.960 --> 26:37.400
I remember you once said

26:37.520 --> 26:41.000
you wanted to find a place
with beautiful nature with me

26:41.000 --> 26:43.530
where we could
live like immortals together.

26:45.240 --> 26:46.170
Don't be afraid.

26:47.720 --> 26:49.860
Our wish is about to come true.

27:29.880 --> 27:30.510
Madam Jin!

27:48.810 --> 27:49.610
Why?

27:53.360 --> 27:54.900
Have you kept the promise

27:56.160 --> 27:57.820
you made to me all these years?

27:59.880 --> 28:01.610
I haven't harmed anyone since.

28:03.310 --> 28:04.160
Very good.

28:04.820 --> 28:06.390
You've redeemed yourself.

28:04.880 --> 28:06.320
♪ I still remember the light ♪

28:07.090 --> 28:08.970
♪ In your eyes that night ♪

28:08.400 --> 28:10.000
Continue to be a good person,

28:10.680 --> 28:12.190
so in your next life,

28:11.890 --> 28:13.370
♪ It lit up all the most beautiful lies ♪

28:12.370 --> 28:14.000
you'll be born into a good family.

28:14.000 --> 28:15.940
♪ I've ever seen ♪

28:15.680 --> 28:16.480
Why?

28:17.790 --> 28:18.680
I...

28:19.110 --> 28:20.410
♪ The silence and heat of the moonlight ♪

28:19.620 --> 28:21.130
I must pay for the sins

28:21.300 --> 28:22.970
♪ Fall on my shoulder ♪

28:23.350 --> 28:24.750
I have committed myself.

28:24.880 --> 28:25.510
No.

28:25.320 --> 28:26.900
♪ The galaxy ♪

28:26.920 --> 28:28.170
You are a Bodhisattva.

28:28.170 --> 28:29.860
♪ Flow on my fingers ♪

28:28.830 --> 28:29.890
You shouldn't die.

28:31.610 --> 28:34.720
♪ Those unrevealed wishes ♪

28:36.100 --> 28:40.480
♪ My heartbeat is hiding,
only the wind is shaking ♪

28:36.790 --> 28:37.640
Run!

28:42.460 --> 28:45.580
♪ The stars fall into the sea ♪

28:46.490 --> 28:48.940
♪ Light up the light in your eyes ♪

28:49.850 --> 28:50.800
♪ The lies at this moment ♪

28:51.720 --> 28:55.050
♪ Are so beautiful it's ridiculous ♪

28:56.160 --> 28:58.980
♪ The youth is endless ♪

29:00.170 --> 29:02.410
♪ Love grows in time ♪

29:00.790 --> 29:01.680
Get lost!

29:03.670 --> 29:10.730
♪ You are the old wound in my palm ♪

29:29.240 --> 29:30.770
If you're going to hell,

29:32.880 --> 29:34.250
I'll go with you.

29:38.010 --> 29:40.960
♪ The stars fall into the sea ♪

29:41.880 --> 29:44.360
♪ Light up the light in your eyes ♪

29:45.320 --> 29:46.330
♪ The lies at this moment ♪

29:47.240 --> 29:50.390
♪ Are so beautiful it's ridiculous ♪

29:51.460 --> 29:54.580
♪ The youth is endless ♪

29:55.470 --> 29:57.940
♪ Love grows in time ♪

29:58.980 --> 30:06.120
♪ You are the old wound in my palm ♪

30:11.880 --> 30:13.410
Congratulations, My Lord,

30:13.640 --> 30:16.350
for leading the Feiyu Guard
to eliminate this great demon.

30:16.350 --> 30:18.880
The court will surely
reward you generously.

30:20.920 --> 30:23.110
The Qionghua Master
was severely poisoned,

30:23.110 --> 30:25.030
and both he and his wife have perished.

30:25.030 --> 30:26.160
If there's a reward,

30:26.590 --> 30:28.480
we should get the lion's share,
shouldn't we?

30:28.480 --> 30:29.310
Yes, indeed.

30:29.310 --> 30:30.340
You...

30:30.720 --> 30:33.000
You Qionghua Sect members
are completely twisting the facts

30:33.000 --> 30:34.110
and have no shame!

30:34.110 --> 30:35.110
You're the ones
who forgo honor for profit.

30:35.110 --> 30:37.070
The credit belongs to us Feiyu Guards.

30:37.070 --> 30:38.670
Isn't that right, brothers?

31:20.760 --> 31:21.630
Li?

31:29.510 --> 31:30.160
Li?

31:33.480 --> 31:34.290
Li?

31:45.310 --> 31:47.270
This is what happens
when you don't cultivate properly.

31:47.270 --> 31:49.000
You end up in human hands,

31:49.000 --> 31:50.930
becoming nothing but a plaything.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.910
I think it looks quite happy though.

31:53.910 --> 31:54.510
Yes,

31:55.190 --> 31:56.200
I think so too.

31:57.430 --> 31:58.920
Master, I'd like to ask...

31:59.000 --> 31:59.790
In this world,

31:59.790 --> 32:01.590
there are many more girls like you

32:01.590 --> 32:03.250
who need Li's healing.

32:04.790 --> 32:06.080
If you miss him,

32:06.260 --> 32:08.020
use the eyes he gave you

32:08.070 --> 32:09.710
to see all things in this world.

32:09.710 --> 32:11.110
He would surely be happy.

32:11.850 --> 32:14.390
But we agreed to see it together.

32:14.920 --> 32:17.030
How could he break his promise?

32:18.920 --> 32:19.640
Because

32:20.720 --> 32:22.240
he had a more important vow

32:22.580 --> 32:23.600
to keep.

32:29.330 --> 32:31.460
Can someone keep Flower Lady in check?

32:31.480 --> 32:32.270
What are you doing,

32:32.270 --> 32:34.000
hugging and biting me all over?

32:35.400 --> 32:36.040
Coming.

32:37.030 --> 32:38.750
She was quite obedient.

32:38.750 --> 32:39.790
Obedient?

32:40.640 --> 32:42.100
Let me tell you something.

32:43.960 --> 32:45.880
When we cultivate...

32:46.550 --> 32:47.280
What is this?

32:55.920 --> 32:58.120
This is a fragment of the Kunlun Mirror.

33:01.040 --> 33:02.310
When all eight pieces are gathered,

33:02.310 --> 33:04.610
it will open the path
to Penglang Celestial Mountain

33:04.610 --> 33:06.140
and lead to the Yuli Spring.

33:07.440 --> 33:08.700
How did it end up here?

33:14.070 --> 33:15.080
The fragments of the Kunlun Mirror

33:15.080 --> 33:17.340
are formed from emotional attachments.

33:17.880 --> 33:20.820
The eight pieces represent
life's eight sufferings.

33:20.820 --> 33:22.620
This particular piece is called

33:23.200 --> 33:24.530
"Lasting Resentment."

33:47.200 --> 33:51.150
Birth, aging, sickness, death.

33:51.510 --> 33:52.830
Separation from the beloved.

33:52.830 --> 33:54.030
Lasting resentment.

33:54.400 --> 33:55.660
Unfulfilled desires.

33:56.270 --> 33:57.400
Inability to let go.

34:05.830 --> 34:06.510
Mortals

34:06.890 --> 34:10.010
always chase elusive immortality,

34:10.440 --> 34:13.040
yet overlook the happiness
right before them.

34:25.590 --> 34:26.320
Come in.

34:35.230 --> 34:36.159
Why are you here?

34:43.840 --> 34:44.900
This jade pendant,

34:45.800 --> 34:46.730
take it with you.

34:50.719 --> 34:51.780
Whenever you call,

34:52.199 --> 34:53.400
I will surely appear.

35:04.360 --> 35:05.070
Thank you.

35:06.190 --> 35:06.850
But no need.

35:11.320 --> 35:13.120
I've been through a lot recently

35:13.760 --> 35:15.760
and my mind has become much clearer.

35:15.920 --> 35:16.920
I've realized

35:18.110 --> 35:19.820
that I must rely on myself

35:19.920 --> 35:21.720
and not always depend on others.

35:22.110 --> 35:23.000
Even if it's me?

35:24.770 --> 35:25.810
Even you.

35:32.800 --> 35:34.040
To others,

35:34.810 --> 35:36.470
I am the Monarch of All Demons,

35:37.840 --> 35:38.920
but to you,

35:39.360 --> 35:40.590
I am just your Hong Ye,

35:42.220 --> 35:43.500
your eternal support.

35:48.670 --> 35:49.490
Before,

35:50.880 --> 35:51.890
I was wrong.

35:56.350 --> 35:58.350
Let's not mention the past anymore.

36:01.840 --> 36:02.920
What I want is

36:03.840 --> 36:05.800
to have at least the same level of magic

36:05.800 --> 36:07.130
as Xiao Ming and Xiao Mu.

36:07.800 --> 36:09.760
Though not as powerful as you—
the strongest in the world—

36:09.760 --> 36:11.160
but when facing threats,

36:11.190 --> 36:12.920
I could at least defend myself.

36:13.840 --> 36:15.710
Strong enough to survive

36:15.710 --> 36:17.070
Hei Wu and Bingzhu,

36:17.070 --> 36:19.670
while protecting
Dali, Luoluo and the others.

36:20.400 --> 36:20.960
Also,

36:23.960 --> 36:25.230
I don't want

36:25.480 --> 36:27.380
you to be in danger
because of me in the future.

36:27.380 --> 36:28.130
I don't mind,

36:29.230 --> 36:29.960
no matter how difficult it gets.

36:29.960 --> 36:31.890
All right, I need to go to class now.

36:45.630 --> 36:46.710
That's not right.

36:46.710 --> 36:47.280
What's going on?

36:47.280 --> 36:47.800
Let me do it.

36:47.800 --> 36:48.510
You do it.

36:51.710 --> 36:53.110
You didn't recite the incantation.

36:53.110 --> 36:53.920
Didn't I?

36:54.070 --> 36:55.630
Let's do it together. Let's charge at it.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.430
Ready, begin.

36:59.000 --> 36:59.660
Transform!

37:00.150 --> 37:02.460
It's not working. Could it be the leaf?

37:02.630 --> 37:03.360
This one looks like it.

37:03.360 --> 37:04.030
Let's try this one.

37:04.030 --> 37:04.550
No.

37:09.550 --> 37:12.150
To have survived
the Demons' Valley disaster—

37:12.320 --> 37:14.360
you owe your lives

37:14.840 --> 37:16.280
to the protection

37:16.670 --> 37:18.070
of countless ancestors.

37:18.510 --> 37:20.360
The humans have retreated for now,

37:20.360 --> 37:21.760
but if they attack again,

37:22.400 --> 37:24.630
with your current power and skills,

37:25.630 --> 37:27.830
will you be able to protect yourselves?

37:29.550 --> 37:30.680
From today onwards,

37:31.070 --> 37:33.270
classes in Demons' Valley will resume.

37:33.280 --> 37:36.340
The assessments
will also become extremely rigorous.

37:36.800 --> 37:38.200
Everyone must remember:

37:38.840 --> 37:40.840
you must master lethal techniques,

37:41.400 --> 37:42.460
and know sly tricks

37:43.440 --> 37:44.480
as well.

37:47.770 --> 37:48.590
He looks exactly like him!

37:48.590 --> 37:49.960
Even the clothes are the same.

37:49.960 --> 37:51.230
To subdue humans,

37:52.590 --> 37:54.450
besides absolute power,

37:55.680 --> 37:57.940
you must also manipulate their desires.

37:58.910 --> 38:00.360
And human desires

38:01.000 --> 38:02.630
are nothing but money,

38:03.000 --> 38:03.760
power,

38:04.190 --> 38:05.280
and appearances.

38:07.990 --> 38:10.850
Humans are driven by their desires.

38:11.440 --> 38:12.070
Humans

38:12.630 --> 38:14.230
are nothing but slaves

38:14.230 --> 38:15.230
to their desires.

38:18.070 --> 38:19.440
It's fake.

38:22.480 --> 38:24.730
If you want humans to obey,

38:26.550 --> 38:29.090
just give them what they want.

38:30.070 --> 38:31.840
The more they want,

38:32.550 --> 38:33.960
the more willingly

38:35.320 --> 38:37.450
they'll put their lives in your hands.

38:40.760 --> 38:41.690
Don't be afraid.

38:47.590 --> 38:48.430
Pair up.

38:49.070 --> 38:50.330
Use the hair collected

38:51.110 --> 38:53.150
during your human realm test for practice.

38:53.150 --> 38:53.590
This is good.

38:53.590 --> 38:56.430
Those who fail to transform today

38:59.550 --> 39:00.810
will stay after class.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.280
Detention again.

39:02.630 --> 39:03.360
So annoying.

39:06.030 --> 39:06.970
Actually,

39:07.360 --> 39:08.860
humans don't live

39:09.000 --> 39:10.190
solely for power, money,

39:10.190 --> 39:12.180
and appearances.

39:12.510 --> 39:13.790
For many humans,

39:13.960 --> 39:16.320
these things are far less important
than family and friends.

39:16.320 --> 39:16.940
Yeah.

39:20.000 --> 39:21.320
If we want to understand humans,

39:21.320 --> 39:22.780
we shouldn't generalize.

39:23.190 --> 39:25.470
Actually, humans are like demons,

39:25.710 --> 39:27.570
they also have emotions and love.

39:29.840 --> 39:31.270
Emotions and love?

39:32.750 --> 39:34.590
Those are just the most despicable means

39:34.590 --> 39:36.720
humans use to disrupt our demon realm.

39:37.400 --> 39:38.930
Among the humans we've met,

39:39.110 --> 39:41.040
how many showed genuine feelings?

39:41.070 --> 39:41.480
Right.

39:43.340 --> 39:45.470
Is it the hypocritical Qionghua Sect,

39:45.800 --> 39:48.530
or the Feiyu Guard
who plundered Demons' Valley?

39:52.700 --> 39:53.440
Only enemies

39:53.440 --> 39:55.900
can see their enemies' weaknesses clearly.

39:56.000 --> 39:57.320
-Xiao Yao...
-Stop talking about this.

39:57.320 --> 39:59.070
She has stayed
in the human realm for too long

39:59.070 --> 40:00.930
and has been bewitched by humans.

40:01.030 --> 40:02.000
She is punished to copy

40:02.000 --> 40:04.880
the "Records of Despicable Human Tactics"
10 times after class

40:04.880 --> 40:05.960
to wake herself up.

40:05.960 --> 40:06.510
But...

40:10.670 --> 40:11.480
Pair up.

40:12.090 --> 40:13.750
Come get hair samples from me,

40:14.480 --> 40:16.480
and start practicing immediately.

40:16.840 --> 40:17.640
I'll go first.

40:19.320 --> 40:20.030
Here I come.

40:28.030 --> 40:28.710
Luoluo!

40:28.710 --> 40:30.370
Your nose is completely gone.

40:35.110 --> 40:35.710
My turn.

40:44.030 --> 40:45.230
I look quite handsome, don't I?

40:45.230 --> 40:47.900
Yes! You're still attractive as a man.

40:52.140 --> 40:53.240
Poor.

40:54.030 --> 40:55.030
Why?

40:55.510 --> 40:56.590
I transformed quite well.

40:56.590 --> 40:57.480
-Yeah.
-How can we be Poor?

40:57.480 --> 40:58.940
-It was good.
-Next group.

40:59.360 --> 40:59.960
Let me try!

41:00.150 --> 41:01.360
Wasn't it pretty good?

41:01.360 --> 41:01.840
It was.

41:01.840 --> 41:03.550
This didn't disappear.

41:03.550 --> 41:04.950
Why did you get Poor then?

41:04.960 --> 41:05.960
I couldn't speak.

41:09.630 --> 41:11.190
The Prefect's daughter.

41:13.220 --> 41:15.480
So this is what it feels like
to be fleshy.

41:25.350 --> 41:26.340
I did it!

41:31.280 --> 41:32.910
Tiger, you're so good.

41:37.360 --> 41:38.380
Tiger's tail.

41:40.550 --> 41:41.320
Very Poor.

41:42.190 --> 41:43.190
Keep practicing.

41:45.630 --> 41:47.290
Why didn't you hide yourself?

41:47.780 --> 41:50.180
This kind of
Feiyu Guard isn't scary at all.

41:52.630 --> 41:53.590
I'm dying of laughter.

41:53.590 --> 41:54.320
Is it funny?

41:54.760 --> 41:55.460
Yes, it is.

41:58.630 --> 41:59.290
Transform.

42:00.760 --> 42:01.470
Come on!

42:14.110 --> 42:15.070
Looks exactly like him.

42:15.070 --> 42:15.940
Amazing!
